      "writtenOn": "2020-02-13T09:33:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This feature makes sense only for uclamp.min, since we use it to provide a boost hold feature.\nI don\u0027t see cases for uclamp.max, do we have one?\n\nI\u0027m wondering if we should not make the name more explicit, i.e. `uclamp.min.hold_ms`?\nOr otherwise add a pair of attributes, so that each clamp can be independently controlled.",
